{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>WallJoy 是一款主打高清手機桌布瀏覽與下載的工具，內建數以百萬計的風景、城市、星空與花卉圖片，適合喜歡經常替手機換新外觀，又不想花時間四處搜圖的用戶。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，提供每日精選、關鍵字搜尋與一鍵儲存功能，瀏覽過程不設廣告。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-47.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能分類配合關鍵字搜尋</h2>\n<p>所有桌布均為高解像度，並針對直向螢幕比例最佳化，套用後不會模糊或拉伸。應用程式把圖片分類為自然風景、城市夜色、動物、花卉、海洋與星空等主題，每日精選欄目會推送熱門作品；輸入關鍵字即可在龐大圖庫中篩選，看到心儀圖片可一鍵存入相簿，或按愛心收藏備用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-41-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-42-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-43-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-44-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：WallJoy</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/walljoy/id6761767097?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.512951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:17:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:54.531667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:54.531667+00:00","content_hash":"57c6f8bca14d8804eef4fa10676912174d955baf04eb4709b8ef9eb19b0a2dca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}